# walk-explore: load the shipped saved game A (the party of six in the Phlan streets at 15,4 facing west),
# walk and turn, open the area map, view a character sheet, look and search. Covers the 3D view, movement,
# the area map, the view screens and the saved game loader (SAVE\SAVGAMA.DAT and the character files).
# Keys: UP moves forward, LEFT and RIGHT turn; A area map (ESC closes it); V view (ESC leaves it); S search; L look.
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A                    # load saved game A
wait 300
shot loaded
key UP
wait 25
key LEFT
wait 25
